[{"title":"拟古诗七十首（录一十三首） 其十一 高常侍适咏途","author":"盛时泰","text":"孟渚多悲风，入夜复及朝。\n春来渚水绿，爱此颜色娇。\n凌晨骑马出，射落云中雕。\n自从服官来，身得为下僚。\n封丘一作尉，始觉身为劳。\n归家视妻子，短发何萧萧。\n入官已三日，暗觉秋风摇。\n人生贵适意，何不归掷枭。\n里中诸年少，安用折简招。\n在昔马相如，曾题万里桥。\n何如拥文君，犊鼻谢金貂。\n始悔出门意，道途空寥寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗七十首（录一十三首） 其十二 李翰林白自明","author":"盛时泰","text":"从来解歌人，古时有秦青。\n酌酒不得见，为我陶性灵。\n空与龌龊士，拘然同一形。\n红颜一以变，鬒发将成星。\n狂来且须饮，罄此双玉瓶。\n暂醉花下眠，忘此春冥冥。\n葡萄夏初熟，颗颗如紫玉。\n凉月夜不扃，遂向月中宿。\n月中有嫦娥，应来下相逐。\n携我上天去，姓名抛鬼录。\n我愿为嫦娥，从新制歌曲。\n一醉十万龄，翻嫌药杵促。\n素娥不知数，一一向我瞩。\n我把白榆浆，顷刻变醽醁。\n素娥意不投，掷我下海舟。\n长风三万里，知向何方游。\n龙宫敞双阙，阍者反见求。\n问我名与姓，身上云烟浮。\n但知去所向，不计来何由。\n我见长须宰，呼为人世囚。\n送我上天界，焉能处中州。\n海波遂腾沸，浪起如山丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗七十首（录一十三首） 其十三 杜员外甫述贬","author":"盛时泰","text":"自予来巴州，得继昔贤后。\n游览锦官城，功名奚所取。\n溪边一草堂，缚茅自吾手。\n宾朋虽众多，性情无所偶。\n醉来赋新诗，豪荡不复有。\n建安与西京，肯为人轻售。\n骑驴自暮归，秋风甘白首。\n面目虽已黎，精神日抖擞。\n丈夫抱经济，进则夔龙耦。\n思以拯苍生，勋庸高北斗。\n肯为升斗粟，易我平生守。\n朝夕贵人前，奴颜效奔走。\n皇天有深仁，兹贬意诚厚。\n昨游孔明祠，眼见柏纹纽。\n扶汉岂不劳，三分帝所受。\n下视曹与孙，心术一何丑。\n觊觎窃神器，不出汉廷授。\n一时忠义人，粉身向齑臼。\n譬彼大厦颠，一木焉能救。\n我今濩落来，所赖惟亲旧。\n君王恩未酬，交结得朋友。\n于以栖余龄，没齿亦何咎。\n所存喘息在，居然共田叟。\n饥寒良切身，履穿还露肘。\n在处与冷汁，聊以充吾口。\n意气干云霄，自知未为负。\n岂为活斯须，所贪在杯酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居赠客","author":"盛时泰","text":"衡门稀客至，翛翛静读书。\n疏帘映秋水，细藻浮游鱼。\n款言落日下，酌酒凉风初。\n出门见黄叶，相送随阶除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同金子坤陪群公登雨花台","author":"盛时泰","text":"绀殿珠宫结驷行，登台共豁远游情。\n林花雨霁双峰出，云木凉生一鸟鸣。\n禁苑晡烟开树色，秦淮春水长潮声。\n却因楚使夸云梦，愧作诸生赋帝京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安院同慧生闲步","author":"盛时泰","text":"玄晖曾弭节，太白亦题诗。\n京邑非前事，新林似往时。\n山深秋气重，谷远罄声迟。\n不为逢支遁，幽怀孰与期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿断臂岩","author":"盛时泰","text":"群山回合处，栖息祇萝烟。\n万木迎寒脱，孤灯入夜悬。\n月同僧意寂，风与客怀牵。\n林外双峰影，高楼对独眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5832,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕子矶","author":"盛时泰","text":"渺渺寒潮带石矶，潮声山色两相依。\n阴云翻浪明秋日，霞气蒸林生晚霏。\n巴蜀船从巫峡下，荆吴人自海门归。\n听歌酌酒银河曙，坐见高天一雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5833,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城山六言四首 其一","author":"盛时泰","text":"微雨才沾麦脚，软风刚报花枝。\n田舍春光几许，江南上巳临时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5834,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城山六言四首 其二","author":"盛时泰","text":"禾黍平连远陌，牛羊半下重冈。\n花影垂帘弄色，茶烟隔屋吹香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5835,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城山六言四首 其三","author":"盛时泰","text":"樵语深林若啸，泉声隔树如雷。\n少妇机丝未罢，老翁社饮初回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5836,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城山六言四首 其四","author":"盛时泰","text":"曲涧鱼游碧藻，寒莎蛩响千林。\n西社归因卖畚，东邻出为修琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5837,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应朱公曾乞蒲团于僧润归榇江州润乃买舟赴葬挂树而去","author":"盛时泰","text":"生前曾与结幽期，身后冥交独有师。\n为挂蒲团思往日，因弹锡杖忆当时。\n泪随雪片应难尽，情断风灯总自持。\n法力护来还不灭，年年慧树长新枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5838,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄武林朱九疑","author":"盛时泰","text":"湖上轻风拂柳条，美人吹笛向平桥。\n欲知胥浦潮初退，正是秦淮雪半消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5839,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同李子馀过彬公兰若","author":"盛时泰","text":"讲堂丛竹旧，相忆对香烟。\n萚谢莺啼后，苔生燕乳前。\n浮生看逝水，湿泪落空筵。\n独有诗名在，应知满大千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5840,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶然作","author":"盛时泰","text":"酒醒闻雨响，况复在山村。\n木叶知时序，鸡声识晓昏。\n七弦频寄兴，二亩足为园。\n清净元无字，逍遥剩有言。\n未能离世网，聊且寄丘樊。\n白足人为侣，玄同道作门。\n茅茨临谷口，烟火出云根。\n为报陶弘景，何时辞帝阍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5841,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过上庄访笪居士","author":"盛时泰","text":"独行深树里，细路绕茅堂。\n山色迎人出，梅花度水香。\n燕泥留雨气，鱼藻入天光。\n住近石桥畔，村沽夜可将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5842,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠蔡公子","author":"盛时泰","text":"桃花落尽客重来，明月高天照酒杯。\n最爱主人年少日，淮阴市上钓鱼回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5843,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城山访邻叟","author":"盛时泰","text":"独是躬耕处，相依亦有君。\n山从千嶂绕，径向一林分。\n水满渔竿觉，苔香屐齿闻。\n从余深隐好，莫使勒移文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5844,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望凭虚阁外山色赠詹东图因寄陈仲鱼","author":"盛时泰","text":"春云如黛点钟陵，湖水生波尽解冰。\n几处东风回弱柳，千岩雨色润垂藤。\n香筵宝座初闻梵，塔院莲龛正试灯。\n阁上莫辞同醉酒，望中原草渐层层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5845,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松屋","author":"盛时泰","text":"高松暑不侵，芭蕉堕新绿。\n茅亭有高士，清溪时濯足。\n天风吹葛巾，醉向亭中宿。\n悠然忘市朝，醒来饭黄犊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5846,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和人游北固","author":"盛时泰","text":"岁暮将何适，三山烟雨边。\n日明知海气，云尽识江天。\n古树开僧寺，寒潮荡客船。\n登临殊有意，濡足祗堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题史痴翁画","author":"盛时泰","text":"老树丫牙铁作柯，乱竹纵横拂云起。\n谁知一段秣陵秋，写在痴翁半边纸。\n痴翁痴翁蓬莱精，有时拈笔人皆惊。\n想见卧痴楼上景，狂歌醉舞鸣秦筝。\n我本大城山里客，看君图画来君宅。\n出门却被强题诗，坐对疏棚豆花白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贮香室（《山云馆杂咏》）","author":"盛时泰","text":"花开研池傍，花落研池底。\n洗研译经时，斛尽龙池水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桧径","author":"盛时泰","text":"苍色映池水，萧萧生暮寒。\n有时秋雨中，遥见山僧还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张玄超自海上寄书问连城生消息","author":"盛时泰","text":"若问青楼娼，芳年二八强。\n轻罗不遮面，绣户自焚香。\n对客时题句，怀君每断肠。\n倘能贻锦字，犹胜梦高唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬梁伯龙","author":"盛时泰","text":"寄迹山中漱碧泉，不将车马老华年。\n青鞋迹遍川原底，《白苎歌》传妓女先。\n雨湿絮粘骄马辔，风吹酒绉玉鳞船。\n秣陵秋老芙蓉发，迟向江头看月圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄淳甫还吴门时倭乱甫定","author":"陈芹","text":"忆君还故宅，追叹昔年违。\n花倚新枝笑，人随旧燕归。\n川原春日澹，桑梓暮阴稀。\n挂壁余孤剑，依然夜有辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日长干寺别友人","author":"陈芹","text":"精舍长干绕，清池曲路通。\n双桥云影上，疏雨梵声中。\n晚岫沉孤翠，秋英吐艳红。\n嘉辰聊一醉，世路漫西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季冬溪阁别张幼于","author":"陈芹","text":"即见雕栏外，丝丝柳拂头。\n水平桃叶渡，花碍木兰舟。\n定拟寻春至，仍须下榻留。\n只怜君去日，雪洒翠云裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和寒山子诗","author":"陈芹","text":"青烟紫雾夕冥冥，似雨飞泉满户庭。\n白日山人无一事，水精帘下阅金经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚归田庐","author":"姚汝循","text":"纡曲春山路，行来日已昏。\n萧然茅宇内，不尽白云屯。\n犬吠初生月，人归半掩门。\n一杯灯影下，幽思共谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后行园","author":"姚汝循","text":"山园积雨后，步屟惜余春。\n柳似酣眠客，花如倦舞人。\n啼莺上乔木，迸笋过比邻。\n韶景行看尽，嬉游可厌频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日闲居","author":"姚汝循","text":"曲巷人踪少，闲门秋草深。\n露香催酒兴，月皎逗琴心。\n园果纷堪摘，池莲冷欲沈。\n重阳佳节近，风日快登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿三山别业","author":"姚汝循","text":"秋深寒露候，地僻水云乡。\n落日枫千树，残霞雁几行。\n桂香清小院，蛩语近匡床。\n自卧沧洲稳，逾憎世路忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柏坊驿题壁","author":"姚汝循","text":"风雨萧萧滞客程，荒亭独宿峭寒生。\n今宵羁思知多少，听尽千山堕叶声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得顾茂俭书及所著离思赋怅然有作","author":"莫是龙","text":"绿鬓伤春卧薜萝，青山起色近如何。\n惯看交态尊前好，较是君情别后多。\n明月自裁希逸赋，片云闲伴莫愁歌。\n家人倘问风尘色，慷慨中原但枕戈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得窗中度落叶二首（青溪社题） 其一","author":"莫是龙","text":"绮疏临野渡，秋树响前林。\n飒飒含风入，纷纷逗雨深。\n拂来红袖掩，积处绿尘侵。\n谁送哀蝉曲，无端搅客心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得窗中度落叶二首（青溪社题） 其二","author":"莫是龙","text":"独树萧萧下，边淮正可怜。\n误投斋阁里，不似御沟前。\n酒户惊秋梦，翻经助夜禅。\n江潭凄恻处，但莫问长年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别","author":"张文柱","text":"惜别复惜别，残更为尔遥。\n青枫薄命叶，黄柳断肠条。\n天迥迟寒雁，江空急暮潮。\n秣陵烟雨际，留得鬓萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"窗中度落叶（青溪社题）","author":"张文柱","text":"袅袅回风下，萧萧薄岁阴。\n一山方隐几，片雨自前林。\n重以轻霜色，凄其入曲心。\n高居尚摇落，不敢更登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访杨逸人山居","author":"李言恭","text":"野人高卧处，只在白云颠。\n绝壁疑无路，深林忽有烟。\n门开千树上，犬吠一峰前。\n尔亦扬雄辈，山中独草《玄》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居乐二首 其一","author":"李言恭","text":"一径杳无车马，万山忽有人家。\n相问不知岁月，惟见开花落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居乐二首 其二","author":"李言恭","text":"夜静白云鹤睡，春深红树莺啼。\n若问幽栖何处，胡麻流出山溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村晚","author":"李言恭","text":"山下数声犬吠，村中几处人归。\n短笛醉横牛背，斜阳正对柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓渡","author":"李言恭","text":"烟树晓栖鸦，长汀带白沙。\n中流聊击楫，新水快浮槎。\n云与人争渡，春随客到家。\n遥知飞彩日，开满石城花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发应城","author":"李言恭","text":"古道风烟接，天涯晓梦迷。\n猿啼千树露，人过一村鸡。\n远浦余灯暗，隔林残月低。\n此时有高卧，予独愧羁栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉江城楼","author":"李言恭","text":"楼阁依山出，城高逼太空。\n帆樯入烟雾，波浪过帘栊。\n灯火深林里，星河流水中。\n人家半渔者，蓑笠挂秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得离字","author":"柳应芳","text":"台城遗迹动凄其，总为前朝足乱离。\n旧路人非芳草在，故宫春尽落花知。\n江山白首犹余恨，鸟雀黄昏亦自悲。\n更是伤心张绪柳，年年空被野风吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得高字","author":"王嗣经","text":"湖山迤逦接亭皋，前代遗踪有石壕。\n别殿佩环归杞棘，修陵凫雁出蓬蒿。\n台荒过午樵歌入，寺近经时梵铎高。\n肠断覆舟山下路，年年春草似青袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得凝字","author":"张正蒙","text":"台城一上路层层，景物萧条感慨增。\n玄武湖秋鸿雁下，华林园冷露霜凝。\n空山僧寺三更磬，隔岸人家半夜灯。\n霸业只今消歇尽，惟余明月照金陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得台字","author":"陈仲溱","text":"平湖一片浸崔嵬，城近黄昏鸟雀哀。\n春草自深沽酒市，天花空落讲经台。\n云埋故垒谁为主，水出青溪更不回。\n六代兴亡成旧梦，翠华驰道上苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得阳字","author":"吴文潜","text":"谩将遗迹问齐梁，寂寂台城露草荒。\n废井尚封陵寝气，初钟不唤景阳妆。\n苍茫野水迷官道，高下寒山出女墙。\n还忆诵经梁武帝，临风倚树吊斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得离字 其一","author":"程汉","text":"独上台城望远空，当年遗迹动悲风。\n怀春罗绮旗亭外，向夕牛羊辇路中。\n几寺残碑深野草，故宫眢井落梧桐。\n只今多少兴亡感，湖水苍茫背郭东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡笼山赋得台城怀古得离字 其一","author":"姚旅","text":"苑城遗迹尽烟霞，草色登台起暮笳。\n地卷豹湖埋帝辇，山横雉堞抱人家。\n风来百舌听经鸟，露泣胭脂坠井花。\n估贩还寻芳乐路，酒帘不动夕阳斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集臧晋叔希林阁寓目钟山诗","author":"臧懋循","text":"钟山郁佳气，龙变与云蒸。\n君看芒砀泽，何似望舂陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集沈氏水亭饯送曹能始北上诗","author":"臧懋循","text":"相送江亭暮，尊空客渐稀。\n杨花不解别，到处逐君飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后湖看荷花共用水香二韵 其一","author":"王野","text":"芬馥满湖田，烨烨朝霞绮。\n朱颜笑倚风，分影与秋水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后湖看荷花共用水香二韵 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"松杉交翠夹堤长，莲子花开满署香。\n玉溆覃拖深覆艇，碧潭历乱密迎榔。\n红舒粉饰齐金制，星缀霞蒸鄂绣张。\n茎刺健能栖翡翠，藕肠弱可系鸳鸯。\n已钟秀丽三山色，复染铅华六代妆。\n城带夕阳翻堞影，岸萦芳草映苔光。\n珠擎既爱田田叶，规接还怜各各房。\n爽气惊林知露早，阴岚拂槛觉杯凉。\n西园夜月同飞盖，南国秋风藉作裳。\n何幸承君生顾盼，岂辞零落委寒塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后湖看荷花共用水香二韵","author":"梅蕃祚","text":"山翠重重傍湖起，北柳南杨映湖水。\n水态秋来锦不如，宛转荷花三十里。\n底用花开十丈长，绕堤无处不闻香。\n叶密花深难辨色，红衣绿羽斗鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后湖看荷花共用水香二韵 其一","author":"陈寺正邦瞻","text":"绿水红蕖欲断肠，可怜秋色似横塘。\n晚风不见木兰枻，明月无人花自香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后湖看荷花共用水香二韵 其一","author":"曹评事学佺","text":"法曹清杀大堤傍，路入荷花不觉长。\n为惜六朝余绮丽，还邀群彦醉壶觞。\n烟轻故罩新开粉，风细时吹不断香。\n彩耽底须愁荡却，文鸳偏自解成行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕公宴赋得博望槎","author":"陈邦瞻","text":"梧桐声脱秋声起，迢迢秋色澹如水。\n天上佳期玉露中，人闲良夜金波里。\n此时汉使向河源，此夕乘槎犯斗垣。\n但惊城舍严官府，那识天孙遇河鼓。\n云阶月地难久留，飘然枯木复乘流。\n归来不问成都卜，肯信身亲见女牛。\n从此人疑有天路，俱言河汉清可度。\n帝子英灵空有人，千秋别泪自沾巾。\n可怜匹练高楼色，年年愁杀问津人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梅主簿子马之长沙","author":"王野","text":"青山满画舫，盖影漾通津。\n秋减江南叶，凉生水上蘋。\n人同梁燕别，月共旅愁新。\n盛世长沙好，之官异楚臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]